SUMMARY:DLRTP Weekly — Deep Learning Architectures & Systems
LOCATION:Frontier RTP\, 800 Park Offices Dr\, Durham\, NC
DESCRIPTION:Let's continue with our survey of developments since GPT-3.\n\n
 Useful starting points:\n\n* [A Visual Tour of LLM of Modern LLM Architect
 ures](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CepbWmGie0E) (youtube 38min)\n* [A s
 lop summary of Reiner Pope's interview ](https://solmaz.io/dwarkesh-reiner
 -pope-llm-training-and-serving)on how LLMs are actually trained and served
 . (Has some useful diagrams)\n* [The Deepseek family of models](https://ww
 w.bentoml.com/blog/the-complete-guide-to-deepseek-models-from-v3-to-r1-and
 -beyond) are the most well documented of the lot for the last two years.\n
 \nInformal\, all levels welcome. Suggestions for future papers and topics 
 welcome.\nRSVP: https://www.meetup.com/deep-learning-rtp/events/317075504/
